OL,3,GNEWSATroubles bill to be discussed in
OL,4,AParliament
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government's Northern Ireland
OL,7,FTroubles Bill is expected to be
OL,8,Fdiscussed in the House of Commons on
OL,9,FTuesday.
OL,11,FThe bill seeks to deal with the
OL,12,Funresolved legacy of the decades-long
OL,13,Fviolent conflict.
OL,15,FThe bill was first introduced to
OL,16,FParliament last year following
OL,17,Fagreement on a joint framework with the
OL,18,FIrish government.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
