OL,3,GNEWSATroubles bill to be discussed in
OL,4,AParliament
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday it was announced that the
OL,7,FAttorney General must provide consent
OL,8,Ffor any serious prosecutions related to
OL,9,Fthe Troubles under changes to the
OL,10,Fplanned legislation.
